//   - k: Number of columns of op( A) and rows of op( B)
//   - alpha: < type > scalar used for multiplication
//   - A: < type > array of dimensions lda x k with lda >= max(1, m) if transa == [OpN] and lda x m with lda >= max(1, k) otherwise
