// Dtrmm This function performs the triangular matrix-matrix multiplication C={αop(A)Bif side == [SideLeft]αBop(A)if side == [SideRight] where A is a triangular matrix stored in lower or upper mode with or without the main diagonal, B and C are m×n matrix, and α is a scalar.
